            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋin, kikama Yosua etaun ŋolo enyaritae Makeda daŋ, toar erwosit keŋ. Tomunya iŋes ŋituŋa daadaŋ alotaun, nyidoŋ tari ipei. Nyelakakina iŋes idiotuŋanan ebucar ka abu kitiyak erwosit a Makeda ŋuna aris iŋes kitiyak neni a erwosit a Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
