          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kipotok Ekapolon Libina daŋ ka erwosit keŋ neni a Ŋisirael, toremo ka tomunyasi a ekileŋ ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu aya nen. Nyelakakina iŋes idiotuŋanan ebucar ka abu kitiyak lorwosit a Libina ŋuna aris iŋes kitiyak lorwosit a Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
