          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipotok Ekapolon Lakis neni a Ŋisirael. Ani epete ŋirwa ŋulu ajiere ŋiarei, kikama Yosua etaun tomunya ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu aya nen a ekileŋ, lopite ŋolopei aris kitiyakinia lotaun Libina.",
          "type": "text",
