              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, abu erwosit Oram ŋolo a Geser tosut akiŋarakin ŋituŋa a Lakis, nai abu Yosua kilou iŋes ka ŋituŋa keŋ tomunya daadaŋ nyidoŋ tari ipei.",
          "type": "text",
