          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋin kikamasi ikes etaun tomunyasi a ekileŋ ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu aya nen, lopite ŋolopei aris kemunyariata ŋituŋa a Lakis.",
